  "goodToKnow": "Der Weitblick is foresight or vision: politischer, unternehmerischer Weitblick, and literally a wide, distant view. Weitblickend means far-sighted. The synonym die Weitsicht can also mean visibility. The opposite is die Kurzsichtigkeit, both short-sightedness of eyes and of policy. Willy Brandt's Ostpolitik is often praised as an example of Weitblick. It has no plural."
